  "scope": "The actual mixed-label form of4.8 is proved with arbitrary old RV labels. Every positive VF2 coordinate-density object has a full original-Gamma VF-preserving graph refinement into a definable two-cell family, retaining finite label fibres and the literal selected density; the graph map is an actual VFVolumeBijection and unary relative to both coordinates. Pointwise two-cell comparisons also allow a finite RV parameter tuple in an actual small definably closed context preserving original VF independence. These prove the cell-refinement step and the RV-parameterized pointwise comparison, not global cell-family volume comparison or full7.7. Higher-dimensional exchange and7.8-7.15 remain open.",
